<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>The Rhythm of the Night</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Corona</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">The Rhythm Of The Night</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4oUr6mgNSjQjyGs8kbXzU5</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.720" end="00:02.350">This is the rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.350" end="00:10.350" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.520" end="00:17.490">This is the rhythm of the life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.490" end="00:25.490" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.220" end="00:37.710">You put some joy upon my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.710" end="00:39.210" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.030" end="00:41.750">Oh sunshine in an empty place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.750" end="00:43.250" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.950" end="00:47.550">Take me to turn to and babe I'll make you stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.550" end="00:50.200" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.200" end="00:52.700">Oh I can ease you of your pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.700" end="00:54.440" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.440" end="00:56.770">Feel you give me love again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.770" end="00:58.340" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.340" end="01:02.750">Round and round we go each time I hear you say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.750" end="01:04.250" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.210" end="01:06.080">This is the rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.080" end="01:07.580" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.010" end="01:09.900">The night oh yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.900" end="01:11.400" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.840" end="01:12.450">The rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.450" end="01:13.950" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.300" end="01:15.670">This is the rhythm of my life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.670" end="01:17.170" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.350" end="01:19.300">My life oh yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.300" end="01:20.800" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.090" end="01:22.260">The rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.260" end="01:30.260" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.390" end="01:45.040">Won't you teach me how to love and learn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.040" end="01:46.540" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.330" end="01:48.940">There I'll be nothing left for me to yearn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.940" end="01:50.650" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.650" end="01:54.630">Think of me and burn and let me hold your hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.630" end="01:57.570" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.570" end="02:00.200">I don't wanna face the world in tears</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.200" end="02:01.700" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.460" end="02:03.990">Please think again I'm on my knees</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.990" end="02:05.750" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.750" end="02:07.590">Take song to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.590" end="02:09.540">No reason to repent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.540" end="02:11.040" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.600" end="02:12.100">I knew you say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.560" end="02:13.700">This is the rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.700" end="02:15.200" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.370" end="02:17.400">The night oh yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.400" end="02:18.900" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.120" end="02:19.920">The rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.920" end="02:21.420" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.030" end="02:23.130">This is the rhythm of my life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.130" end="02:24.630" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.390" end="02:27.030">My life oh yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.030" end="02:28.530" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.190" end="02:30.100">The rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.100" end="02:31.600" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.760" end="02:33.830">This is the rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.830" end="02:40.110" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.110" end="02:43.930">This is the rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.930" end="02:51.390" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.390" end="02:52.890">This is the rhythm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.600" end="02:54.100" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.200" end="02:54.700">This is the rhythm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.150" end="02:55.650" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.140" end="02:58.910">This is the rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.910" end="03:00.410">This is the rhythm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.040" end="03:01.540" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.580" end="03:02.080">This is the rhythm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.620" end="03:03.120" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.420" end="03:05.780">This is the rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.780" end="03:07.280" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.300" end="03:08.640">This is the rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.640" end="03:10.140" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.190" end="03:11.960">The night oh yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.960" end="03:13.460" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.200" end="03:14.890">The rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.890" end="03:16.390" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.570" end="03:17.670">This is the rhythm of my life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.670" end="03:19.170" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.550" end="03:21.360">My life oh yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.360" end="03:22.860" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.460" end="03:24.170">The rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.170" end="03:25.670" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.910" end="03:28.020">This is the rhythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:28.020" end="03:32.020" /></div></body></tt>